flowchart LR
  subgraph Inputs[Authorized family information]
    Mail[Email and notifications<br/>provider path unverified]
    Calendar[Existing calendar feeds<br/>provider path unverified]
    School[School and activity sources<br/>planned or account-dependent]
    Import[Parent-supplied files<br/>authorized access required]
  end

  subgraph Intake[Source boundary]
    Adapters[Provider adapters and imports<br/>live coverage unverified]
    Evidence[Source records and evidence]
  end

  subgraph Core[Family workspace]
    Web[Next.js family interface]
    API[FastAPI application]
    Store[(PostgreSQL-compatible data model)]
    Review[Review, tasks, decisions, conflicts]
    Audit[Attribution and audit history]
  end

  Demo[Synthetic/local demo records]
  AI[AI research prototypes\nnot enabled in production]
  Writer[Approved calendar output\nseparately gated]

  Mail -. unverified provider path .-> Adapters
  Calendar -. unverified provider path .-> Adapters
  School -. planned or account-dependent .-> Adapters
  Import -. authorization-dependent .-> Adapters
  Demo --> Evidence
  Evidence --> API
  Web <--> API
  API <--> Store
  API --> Review
  API --> Audit
  Evidence -. synthetic prototype only .-> AI
  Review -. separate approval required .-> Writer

  classDef current fill:#e8f1e9,stroke:#496b56,color:#173222;
  classDef gated fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#9c7430,color:#422f0a;
  class Web,API,Store,Review,Audit,Evidence,Demo current;
  class AI,Writer,School,Mail,Calendar,Import,Adapters gated;
